{"id":"dd316f316437dd24","group":"29","path":"29/29-df-so-so-exists.md","title":"存在二阶逻辑","display":"df-so-so-exists — 存在二阶逻辑","type":"definition","metadata":{"type":"definition","book":"Descriptive Complexity (Neil Immerman)","book_abbrev":"29","label":"29-df-so-so-exists","aliases":["29-df-so-so-exists"],"display":"df-so-so-exists — 存在二阶逻辑","depends_on":["[[29-df-so-hierarchy]]","[[29-df-second-order]]","[[29-df-sentence]]","[[29-df-bool-query]]","[[29-df-fo-q-fo]]","[[29-df-so-quantifier-semantics]]"],"source_locator":"§7.1, pp.113–115, DjVu scans 128–130","source_basis":"用户提供的 DjVu 隐藏文本层；核对范围见 Remark"},"metadataError":null,"renderWarnings":[],"properties":[{"key":"type","html":"definition"},{"key":"book","html":"Descriptive Complexity (Neil Immerman)"},{"key":"book_abbrev","html":"29"},{"key":"label","html":"29-df-so-so-exists"},{"key":"aliases","html":"<div class=\"property-array\"><span>29-df-so-so-exists</span></div>"},{"key":"display","html":"df-so-so-exists — 存在二阶逻辑"},{"key":"depends_on","html":"<div class=\"property-array\"><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-1\" data-note=\"7bd2cd8b0f2698f9\" href=\"?note=7bd2cd8b0f2698f9\" title=\"29-df-so-hierarchy\">29-df-so-hierarchy</a></span><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-2\" data-note=\"4db9fd38055efd65\" href=\"?note=4db9fd38055efd65\" title=\"29-df-second-order\">29-df-second-order</a></span><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-3\" data-note=\"711217f22972ffc0\" href=\"?note=711217f22972ffc0\" title=\"29-df-sentence\">29-df-sentence</a></span><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-4\" data-note=\"92256ad8556a5baf\" href=\"?note=92256ad8556a5baf\" title=\"29-df-bool-query\">29-df-bool-query</a></span><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-5\" data-note=\"b89b00b2e37a4ae5\" href=\"?note=b89b00b2e37a4ae5\" title=\"29-df-fo-q-fo\">29-df-fo-q-fo</a></span><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-6\" data-note=\"8372f1f6b9135d87\" href=\"?note=8372f1f6b9135d87\" title=\"29-df-so-quantifier-semantics\">29-df-so-quantifier-semantics</a></span></div>"},{"key":"source_locator","html":"§7.1, pp.113–115, DjVu scans 128–130"},{"key":"source_basis","html":"用户提供的 DjVu 隐藏文本层；核对范围见 Remark"}],"html":"\n<h2 id=\"Hypothesis\">[Hypothesis]</h2>\n<ul>\n<li>\n<p><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\tau\">\\(\\tau\\)</span> 为有限词汇；<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{RelVar}_k\">\\(\\mathrm{RelVar}_k\\)</span> 与 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{RelVar}\">\\(\\mathrm{RelVar}\\)</span> 见 <a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-7\" data-note=\"4db9fd38055efd65\" href=\"?note=4db9fd38055efd65\" title=\"29-df-second-order\">29-df-second-order</a>。</p>\n</li>\n<li>\n<p><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\bar R=(R_1,\\ldots,R_m)\">\\(\\bar R=(R_1,\\ldots,R_m)\\)</span> 为互异且不属于 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\tau\">\\(\\tau\\)</span> 的关系变量；各自元数固定且为正。</p>\n</li>\n<li>\n<p><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\operatorname{Mod}^{\\mathrm{SO}}_\\tau\">\\(\\operatorname{Mod}^{\\mathrm{SO}}_\\tau\\)</span> 使用 <a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-8\" data-note=\"8372f1f6b9135d87\" href=\"?note=8372f1f6b9135d87\" title=\"29-df-so-quantifier-semantics\">29-df-so-quantifier-semantics</a> 的二阶满足关系，模型类接口见 <a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-9\" data-note=\"b89b00b2e37a4ae5\" href=\"?note=b89b00b2e37a4ae5\" title=\"29-df-fo-q-fo\">29-df-fo-q-fo</a>。</p>\n</li>\n<li>\n<p><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\Sigma_1^1[\\tau]\">\\(\\Sigma_1^1[\\tau]\\)</span> 取 <a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-10\" data-note=\"7bd2cd8b0f2698f9\" href=\"?note=7bd2cd8b0f2698f9\" title=\"29-df-so-hierarchy\">29-df-so-hierarchy</a> 的唯一正式定义，允许长度零的二阶前缀。</p>\n</li>\n</ul>\n<h2 id=\"Assertion\">[Assertion]</h2>\n<figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\exists\\mathrm{SO}[\\tau]\\coloneqq\\Sigma_1^1[\\tau].\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\exists\\mathrm{SO}[\\tau]\\coloneqq\\Sigma_1^1[\\tau].\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"Q(\\exists\\mathrm{SO})[\\tau]\\coloneqq\\{\\operatorname{Mod}^{\\mathrm{SO}}_\\tau(\\varphi)\\mid\\varphi\\in\\Sigma_1^1[\\tau]\\}.\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[Q(\\exists\\mathrm{SO})[\\tau]\\coloneqq\\{\\operatorname{Mod}^{\\mathrm{SO}}_\\tau(\\varphi)\\mid\\varphi\\in\\Sigma_1^1[\\tau]\\}.\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><h2 id=\"Remark\">[Remark]</h2>\n<p>原书 §7.1，印刷页 113–115，扫描页 128–130。矩阵是扩展词汇上的闭 FO 句子，二阶量词约束新增关系；统一 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\Sigma_1^1\">\\(\\Sigma_1^1\\)</span> 的定义归属，并修复把 ESO 句子传给仅对 FO 定义的模型类函数的类型错误。</p>\n","headings":[{"id":"Hypothesis","text":"[Hypothesis]","level":2},{"id":"Assertion","text":"[Assertion]","level":2},{"id":"Remark","text":"[Remark]","level":2}],"links":[{"target":"29-df-so-hierarchy","status":"resolved","id":"7bd2cd8b0f2698f9","anchor":"ref-1","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[29-df-so-hierarchy]]","embed":false},{"target":"29-df-second-order","status":"resolved","id":"4db9fd38055efd65","anchor":"ref-2","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[29-df-second-order]]","embed":false},{"target":"29-df-sentence","status":"resolved","id":"711217f22972ffc0","anchor":"ref-3","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[29-df-sentence]]","embed":false},{"target":"29-df-bool-query","status":"resolved","id":"92256ad8556a5baf","anchor":"ref-4","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[29-df-bool-query]]","embed":false},{"target":"29-df-fo-q-fo","status":"resolved","id":"b89b00b2e37a4ae5","anchor":"ref-5","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[29-df-fo-q-fo]]","embed":false},{"target":"29-df-so-quantifier-semantics","status":"resolved","id":"8372f1f6b9135d