$ 与 $\\exists\\mathrm{SO}$ 的句子集和语义见 [[29-df-second-order]]、[[29-df-so-so-exists]]。"},{"id":"38909ffa6d1e85ce","anchor":"ref-40","locations":["正文"],"count":1,"excerpt":"[[29-df-so-so-exists]] — 存在二阶逻辑"},{"id":"560196b62ae7159f","anchor":"ref-6","locations":["元数据 · depends_on","正文"],"count":2,"excerpt":"$\\Sigma_1^1[\\tau]$ 与 $Q(\\exists\\mathrm{SO})[\\tau]$ 见 [[29-df-so-so-exists]]；SO 满足使用 [[29-df-so-quantifier-semantics]]。"},{"id":"c6735bb68a79a1ef","anchor":"ref-6","locations":["元数据 · depends_on","正文"],"count":2,"excerpt":"$\\Sigma_1^1[\\tau]$ 与 $Q(\\exists\\mathrm{SO})[\\tau]$ 见 [[29-df-so-so-exists]]；SO 满足使用 [[29-df-so-quantifier-semantics]]。"},{"id":"899acace16f7edbe","anchor":"ref-6","locations":["元数据 · depends_on","正文"],"count":2,"excerpt":"$\\Sigma_1^1[\\tau]$ 与 $Q(\\exists\\mathrm{SO})[\\tau]$ 见 [[29-df-so-so-exists]]；SO 满足使用 [[29-df-so-quantifier-semantics]]。"},{"id":"bc8a56742e504316","anchor":"ref-6","locations":["元数据 · depends_on","正文"],"count":2,"excerpt":"$\\exists\\mathrm{SO}[\\tau]$ 是 [[29-df-so-so-exists]] 的存在二阶句子集；$\\models_{\\mathrm{SO}}$ 见 [[29-df-so-quantifier-semantics]]。"},{"id":"805a7de3b1249a36","anchor":"ref-33","locations":["正文"],"count":1,"excerpt":"[[29-df-so-so-exists]]"},{"id":"ecc0dd131d213345","anchor":"ref-132","locations":["正文"],"count":1,"excerpt":"[[../29-df-so-so-exists]]"}],"outgoing":["7bd2cd8b0f2698f9","4db9fd38055efd65","711217f22972ffc0","92256ad8556a5baf","b89b00b2e37a4ae5","8372f1f6b9135d87"]}